;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "bittersweet.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 800, April 8―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> shielded me and fell into a <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="こんすい">coma</STYLE>.<BR>
According to the doctor, unless a miracle happened, she would probably never open her eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the midst of that despair, that case quietly came to its end.<PG>
And that dealt my heart yet another blow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's mom</STYLE> burned herself to death, and <STYLE ID="4">my mom</STYLE> turned herself in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was arrested, </STYLE>apparently, in connection with the Megasawa City case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But a single ray of light shone through.<PG>
A few days later, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> recovered enough to breathe on her own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that was apparently all she could manage, and she never opened her eyes or made a sound.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I kept waiting for <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> to open her eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For days―for weeks―for months.<PG>
Do miracles really happen?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked up story after story of miracles to comfort myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A high-school boy who opened his eyes for the first time in years after an accident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A young woman who made a miraculous recovery from terminal cancer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A newborn with a congenital disease, given only days to live, who grew up safe and sound.<PG>
Maybe someday a miracle will happen for <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe a day will come when she opens her eyes again and we talk about silly little things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if miracles happened easily, you couldn't call them miracles.<PG>
A miracle is something that happens against astronomical odds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why everyone hopes for miracles.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even thinking it might not happen to them, they still hope.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They hold on to that faint wish―to hope.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Summer vacation's almost here. Now I can be with you all day, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"The air conditioner in this room is a little weak, isn't it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, aren't you hot? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　They say it's going to be a cool summer this year, but they always say that, and it's hot every year."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
There are probably people who'd say something heartless, like that I'm 'talking to a doll.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But parents everywhere talk a lot to babies who can't understand words yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is how people learn words―how they stimulate the brain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I'm doing is the same thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only it could stimulate <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> even a little and give her a push to wake up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah! That came out nice! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I've gotten good at cutting your hair too, haven't I!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I heard it snowed on Mount Motoki the other day. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, do you remember? Back before you moved to Megasawa, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, our families went sledding together. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I hardly remember anything from before you went to Megasawa, but I remember that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"That time... the sled you and I were riding, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, hit a tree, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you got hurt, didn't you? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I didn't get a scratch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, that time too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">that time too, you got hurt shielding me, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm sorry. Always, always, you're the one I put through terrible things, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I've lived my whole life being protected by you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Even now, it's the same. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, if you were gone, I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I won't ever go away from you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. I'll always be with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Heh. I might get you hurt again, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... will you stay with me forever?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I went to <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> hospital room every day without missing a single one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sometimes <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> came too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> had been roped into the student council or something, so she couldn't come often, but when she did, <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> talked to <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"It's gotten a lot warmer. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">It's... cherry blossom season again... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If my health gets bad, I might not be able to come, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">...No, I'll come even if I have to </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="は">crawl</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, if things were normal, you'd already have graduated high school. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But you couldn't get your credits and turned in a withdrawal notice, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what were you planning to do after high school? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　You said you hadn't decided on college or a job, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"And... and another thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The other day, a third-year confessed to me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Asked me to go out with him. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I turned him down, of course. I can't be off enjoying romance all by myself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, I'm not saying it's your fault or anything like that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But... maybe I do long for romance, just a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, wasn't there anyone you liked? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you always dodged that kind of talk, so I never did get to ask. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">You could've at least told me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Or was there really no guy who met your standards, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"If there was, you'd have told me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Aha! What am I saying?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―A year has passed since <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> lost consciousness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What kind of dreams has <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> been having through this year?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Have <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> and I shown up in her dreams?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, has she been able to spend even a little happy time?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if we haven't shown up... as long as <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> can have happy dreams, that's enough.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I... decided to quit high school. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">The money for living expenses is about to run out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> parents and my grandpa and grandma said they'd help me out, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I can't depend on them forever. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">They also told me I should at least graduate from high school. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But... I want to stand on my own even a little sooner, so I can welcome you home, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Maybe I was a little too hasty..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ahaha! I'm an idiot, aren't I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I should just graduate high school, at least. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But... to be honest, I don't have enough credits. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I stopped being able to score anything on tests, and I just can't keep up with my classes anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I'm... like an idiot in all kinds of ways..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
What is my life?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ever since that case, I've never once wondered about that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm alive because <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> shielded me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By rights, I would have died back then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this life of mine is one I live with <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've never once questioned that view of life, either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I found a part-time job yesterday. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Oh, and of course, so I can spend the daytime with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I picked a job at an izakaya. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I can't get into the hospital at night."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"A little while ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and I celebrated with canned juice. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">She congratulated me. Even though she was so against me quitting high school. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Come to think of it, when was the last time </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> came here...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is really busy right now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">There's the student council, and apparently she's being made to write some paper I don't really get. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Being a genius girl really is hard, huh. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> says she'll stay in Motoki-cho even after she graduates. Because she wants to be with us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> says she'll definitely come visit once things settle down, so don't worry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> could get an interest-free scholarship to any college in the world... and she says it's so she can be with us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Ha ha, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> really is my cute junior."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"............? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, did you say something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Was I just imagining it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"So you did say something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"If there's anything you want to say... call out to me anytime."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Right after the case, I used to count 'day so-and-so since the case,' but in time so many months went by that I couldn't anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was already the second summer since <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> lost consciousness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Summer in high school means, of course, youth and stuff like... 
{PAUSE ""}
No, I won't think about things like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll think only about the <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> in front of me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花横顔髪寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! I'm late! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　I had a shift till closing last night, so I was asleep until just now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Aren't you thirsty? Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Are you... saying something after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">can you hear me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"If you feel like you can say something again, tell me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> says she can probably make it today too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">―how long has it been since she was last here? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> hasn't gotten one bit taller. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">She kept saying 'You grow until you're 18!', but at the last school physical she apparently shrank 1 millimeter, and she got really down about it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Even though I told her nobody can tell 1 millimeter!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">""</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
As the months flow by, the times flow on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And people's minds move on, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one talks about the Megasawa City case or the Motoki-cho case anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in this hospital room alone, the flow of time has stopped.<PG>
It should be stopped, and yet we're <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="も">tossed about</STYLE> by that flow of time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like it or not, we grow up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like it or not, time won't wait.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that's exactly why some things get resolved.<PG>
