{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, it's a nice day today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花入院.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh... so bright... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Spring's really here now."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As always, I open the curtains of the hospital room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> keeps her eyes barely open, squinting at the brightness.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yesterday, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">my mom's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> sentence came down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Life imprisonment. Apparently she really was the culprit in the Megasawa City case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you really weren't putting curses on anyone after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Obviously. There's no way I'd want to kill you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That's true. After all, you shielded me with everything you had."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Just then, the hospital room door opens, and a small figure comes in.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Good morning! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Wait... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, what is that? That hairstyle..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> think it's awful too, right?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">What idol is this supposed to be..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Good morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you're finally an exam-taker too!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Well, for the genius girl by her own and everyone's admission, any college entrance exam is a cakewalk!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean 'any'? You're going to Motoki University, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="7">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never settle down, no matter how much time goes by, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is fine just the way she is! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　When she's making deductions and stuff, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> face gets really scary..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's not scary, that's called being serious! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">　Anyway, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, your hair's gotten really long."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't move, so with my hair, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> just does whatever she wants..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But you've got such a good figure, and you always wore boyish clothes..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What? I took good care of the knit dress I got from </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, didn't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But that's the only thing, right? Everything else is big hoodies and jeans. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Maybe it's about time we tried makeup too?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Playing around with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> too much isn't fair to her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Tell her some more!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Come on, you two!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Both <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> always complain about everything I do!<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, soon it'll be, um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">your father's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> third-year memorial service, right? Are you holding a memorial service or anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I thought about it a lot, but I think I'll leave it to Grandpa and Grandma. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I can't leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> during the day."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't worry about it. It's your parents' memorial service, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"It's fine! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you be quiet and be my dress-up doll!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You―! You flat-out called me a dress-up doll!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Now, now, you two... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Couldn't we take </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> along too, in a wheelchair?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that'd put a burden on </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, you're right! Let's do that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you even listening to me...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"You'd get bored with just walks around the hospital, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Besides... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">besides, it's also </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> third-year memorial, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> says so too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>, too, started persuading <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, who wouldn't say yes right away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I really..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Right, it's decided! At the third-year memorial, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is attending too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"H-hey, don't just decide on your own! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Honestly... Fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you'll have to wear makeup after all! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　You'll be 20 soon."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Cut it out! Makeup..."</STYLE><PG>
