{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh, you finally have a day off! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, please take care of your health. </STYLE>
