<STYLE ID="6">But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, freeloading at your house doesn't feel right either..."</STYLE><PG>
My house burned down during the case 2 years ago, and I lost my place to live.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At first I was supposed to stay with Grandpa and Grandma, but <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> suggested I come live at her house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way, it's closer to <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> hospital, too.<PG>
But I didn't want to be a freeloader, so I decided to pay part of my wages to the Goto home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
